  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "DC wintrum & II, \u00fea \u00fea Censorinus Marcus & Mallius & eft sendon Scipian \u00feider, & he hie \u00e6t heora forman gefeohte gefliemde, & bedraf into \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hie b\u00e6don fri\u00f0es Romane. Ac hit Scipia nolde him aliefan wi\u00f0 nanum o\u00ferum \u00feinge butan hie him ealle hiera w\u00e6peno \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t gedon w\u00e6s, hie cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t him leofre w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t hie mid \u00fe\u00e6re byrig Nu ic wille, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, secgean hulucu heo w\u00e6s. Hiere ymbegong w\u00e6s XXX mila; & eall heo w\u00e6s mid s\u00e6 utan befangen, butan \u00ferim milum; & se Hie \u00fea Cartainenses \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m cirre \u00fea burg aweredon, \u00feeh \u00fee Scipia \u00e6r fela \u00fe\u00e6s wealles tobrocen \u00dea \u00fea Gneo Cornelius & Lentulus Lucinius w\u00e6ron consulas, \u00f0a for Scipia \u00feriddan si\u00fee on & \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6rto com, he w\u00e6s VI dagas on \u00fea burg feohtende, o\u00fe \u00fea burgware b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00dea het Scipia ealle \u00fea wifmen \u00e6rest utgan, \u00feara w\u00e6s XXVI M, & \u00fea \u00fea w\u00e6pnedmen, \u00feara w\u00e6s & se cyning Hasterbal hiene selfne acwealde, & his wif mid hiere tw\u00e6m sunum hie selfe & Scipia het ealle \u00fea burg toweorpan, & \u00e6lcne hiewestan tobeatan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie to nanum wealle & seo burg inneweard barn XVI dagas, ymb DCC wintra \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee heo \u00e6r getimbred w\u00e6s. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feridde gewin geend",
